        "The dashboard reads the views"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "How it ran",
      "items": [
        "A SQLite work queue in data/ops.sqlite drove orchestration",
        "ig_posts_gen_batches writes batch_jobs + batch_items with no API calls, sub-millisecond",
        "submit_gemini_batches_job reads batch_jobs status=pending; harvest is sensor-driven",
        "Failures land in dead_letter (776 rows live)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "Known limitations (why the migration started)",
      "items": [
        "IG-only: PK (post_id, domain), domain hardcoded 'instagram'",
